{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大流行天王The Weeknd近日抵港，為本月24日起假啓德體育園主場館舉行合共4場的《The Weeknd: After Hours Til Dawn Tour》香港站作準備。</p><p>距離演唱會開鑼尚有一周，他先抽空與梁朝偉及劉嘉玲共進晚餐。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:18:46.883963+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:43:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:57:34.248665+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:31.821291+00:00","content_hash":"c52b998cb167b02d73b3c79ef18583c715a8997905bf67f566b7ca7e313d7344","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}